{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Getting Fit!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class =\"italic\">disappointed, interested, fascinated, surprised, bored, worried</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tired</span>.<br/><br/>Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> are used to describe things and situations, like <span class =\"italic\">disappointing, fascinating, distracting, distressing, boring, worrying</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tiring</span>.  <br/>These adjectives describe the effect something has on a person.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Which articles did you find less interesting?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I guess that article was a little disappointing for me. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm not very fascinated by that topic.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional to talk about real possibilities in the present or the future. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The first conditional contains two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">if</span> (or </span><span class =\"italic\">when</span>) clause and the <span class =\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The two clauses are interchangeable in terms of their position in a sentence. When the <span class =\"italic\">if</span> or <span class =\"italic\">when</span> clause comes at the beginning of the sentence, you must use a comma after it. When it comes at the end of a sentence, no comma is necessary. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1st Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2nd Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If I meet someone who is in pain,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I could tell them about acupuncture.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible I meet someone who is in pain.  <br> <br> In this condition: I could tell them about acupuncture.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would love to read more on personality \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"if you have the opportunity to write another article.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you have the opportunity to write another article.  <br> <br>In this condition: I would love to read more on personality. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "If I meet someone who is in pain, I could tell them about acupuncture.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I would love to read more on personality if you have the opportunity to write another article. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "caffeinated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "containing caffeine, like coffee, tea or soda", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I never drink caffeinated drinks before going to bed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "beverage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "drink", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What beverages contain a lot of caffeine?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "needle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "instrument used to pierce through something, like material or skin", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't want anyone to put needles in my body anytime soon. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "acupuncture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traditional Chinese practice of placing needles in the body to relieve pain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What do you think about acupuncture?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to laugh", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to respond to a comical situation with a natural reaction of the core body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I agree that it's very healthy to laugh.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sense", "type": "name"}, {"content": "means by which you obtain information about your environment (sight, hearing, touch, etc.)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My preferred sense is hearing. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Look at the situations below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For each situation, prepare a role-play with a partner. Think of health-related key words that will help you to role-play. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the role-play. Remember to start with an introduction and end with a conclusion.  You use the key words, but do not write the dialogue! ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles and choose a different situation, or invent your own situation. You are now the person receiving health advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Situations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your friend can't sleep. They feel stressed, so they drink coffee and play video games late at night.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your friend is feeling a lot of pain in their back, and sometimes they have headaches.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Your friend is bored at work. They want to quit because the environment is so serious.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I review health-related words for a role-play.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice in a role-play.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for advice in a role-play.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le02ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le02ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  So, what did you think of my articles on health this month, Vanessa? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Oh Sally, you're my favorite journalist. I learn so much when I read your stimulating articles. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Which one did you like best?"}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "14500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Everyone feels stress from time to time, so I think the article on humor and health was fascinating. I agree that it's very healthy to laugh. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Which articles did you find less interesting? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, usually I don't have problems sleeping. I never drink caffeinated beverages before going to bed, so I guess that article was a little disappointing for me. I'm not very fascinated by that topic. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK, that's fair enough. What did you think about acupuncture?"}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't feel pain, so I don't want anyone to put needles in my body anytime soon. However, if I meet someone who is in pain, I could tell them about acupuncture. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: And what about the article on colors? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Oh, that was great. My preferred sense is hearing. I would love to read more on personality if you have the opportunity to write another article. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Good to know!"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le02ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about staying healthy.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about someone's feelings and reactions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss how to deal with problems.   ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What are some ways you try to stay healthy?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What would you recommend other people do to stay healthy?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You